## 6. Relationships Between Entities

- **Automotive Solutions, Inc.** partners with **Precision Parts Corp.** and **Global Auto Components** for parts supply, ensuring efficient supply chain management.
- **Greenway Motors** and **EcoDrive Auto Sales** are key dealers for vehicles, receiving training from **Dealer Academy** to enhance customer service.
- **Logistics Express** coordinates the transportation of parts from suppliers such as **EcoBattery Solutions** directly to **Automotive Solutions Manufacturing Plant**.
- **Recall Manager Pro** interfaces with the warranty management system to flag potential recalls based on customer feedback, engaging **Recall Logistics Solutions** for remediation.
- The **Production Scheduling** system relies on data from **Just-In-Time (JIT) Inventory System** to optimize manufacturing operations at the **Automotive Solutions Manufacturing Plant**.

## 7. Conclusion

This technical specification document outlines the requirements and constraints necessary for the successful operation of Automotive Solutions, Inc. in the vehicle manufacturing and supply chain management sectors. By adhering to these guidelines and fostering collaboration among the listed entities, the company aims to maintain its position as a leader in the electric and hybrid vehicle market while ensuring the highest standards of quality and customer satisfaction. 

